fix(lower): Emit warning for unlowered Decl kinds instead of silent drop
scale: ~129 lines across 5 files [M]

- `crates/vox-ast/src/decl/types.rs`: Added `Decl::kind_name()` method to provide a static label for each declaration kind, used in diagnostics.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/hir/lower/mod.rs`: Modified the `LowerCtx`'s catch-all arm for `Decl` lowering to push a `vox.lower.unlowered_decl` warning into `HirModule::lower_warnings` when a declaration kind has no specific HIR lowering arm. The declaration is still added to `legacy_ast_nodes`.
